# Build output, IDE and tooling
**/.classpath
**/.dockerignore
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/azds.yaml
**/bin
**/obj
**/charts
**/docker-compose*
**/Dockerfile*
