LICENSE
README.md
docs

# Logs
**/Logs
**/*.log

# Environment files
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env

# Local and environment-specific app settings
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.Staging.json
**/secrets.json
**/secrets.*.json
**/secrets.*.yaml

# Keys and certificates
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.crt
**/*.cer
**/*.der
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.ppk
**/*.snk
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/certs

# Cloud and tool credentials
**/credentials.json
**/*.azureauth
**/.aws
**/.azure
**/http-client.private.env.json
**/*.private.env.json

# Local databases, backups and dumps
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.mdf
**/*.ldf
**/*.ndf
**/*.bak
**/*.bacpac
**/*.dump

# AI assistant / Claude Code files
**/.claude
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/.mcp.json

# Editors and OS
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
**/desktop.ini
